(title_block (title "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth module") (date "2026-10-25") (rev "A") (company "The OpenDAP Project") (comment 1 "blk.radio") (comment 2 "Murata Type 2EL (IW612): SDIO, UART, wake lines, its 3.3 V and 1.8 V rails"))
(lib_symbols )
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: Murata Type 2EL (NXP IW612): Wi-Fi 6 on SDIO 3.0, Bluetooth 5.4 on UART1 with\n   flow control (feature blocks #39), drawn on two sub-sheets: the module, and its rails with\n   the PDn hold translator.\n2. Absent state: WL_PWR_EN low: both module rails off, PDn low, wake lines pulled to no wake.\n3. Reserved for a PCIe + USB 2x2 module variant (a block revision): the RK3566 PCIe sideband\n   balls and USB HOST3, unconnected (pinout v1, 2026-10-25)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 142.24 0) (size 129.54 19.05) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "94da2cf2-5236-5f1d-bf59-cf9992cc8cbc"))
